(g) A certified copy of all documents evidencing any necessary consent or governmental approvals (if any) with respect to the Loan
Documents or any other documents provided for in this Agreement;
(h) A certificate by the Secretary or any Assistant Secretary of Borrower certifying as to: (i) attached resolutions of Borrower’s Board of
Governors authorizing or ratifying the execution, delivery and performance of the Loan Documents to which Borrower is a party and any other
documents provided for by this Agreement, (ii) the names of each Person authorized to sign the Loan Documents together with a sample of the true
signature of such Person(s), and (iii) attached operating agreement of Borrower;
(i) A copy of Borrower’s articles of organization certified by the Secretary of State;
(j) A Certificate of Good Standing for Borrower issued by its state of organization and by those states requested by Lender;
(k) Evidence of insurance for all insurance required by the Loan Documents;
